+        ``窗口 end <= end_ms`` 的证据——端点不齐的窗口不得被伪装成整段已覆盖。
+        没有任何匹配时返回空列表：消费者据此判「未知」，**绝不当零**（P1-2）。
+        """
+        sql = """SELECT environment,account_ref,income_type,start_ms,end_ms,watermark,
+                        page_limit,coverage_status,gaps_json,termination_proof_json,synced_at_ms
+                 FROM income_coverage
+                 WHERE environment_norm=? AND account_ref_norm=? AND income_type_norm=?"""
+        params: list[Any] = [self._income_norm(environment), self._income_norm(account_ref),
+                             self._income_norm(income_type)]
